invalid type: string "ICFAI School of Architecture\nWhat makes ISArch Unique?\nCampus esprit-  ISArch curriculum is such that it merges \nthe experience of campus life and academics into a blend \nso smooth that architecture seems like calm seas. While \nalong the line the academics show a unique syllabus that is \nconstantly updated to keep the students up-to  date with the \ni Veereswara Sarma\n